i='TCS-3619';_,c=card(i);refs=c['references'];refs[0]['locator']='Concluding remarks, page 5; Definitions 6–9, Theorems 1 and 3. The 2019 notation MrKtP denotes a probability-gap promise problem, unlike the later exact threshold language.'
